{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>KUMARN</strong></i><br><br>A story-rich horror adventure that follows the journey of a lost spirit child trapped in a mysterious, decaying world. After waking up alone in a dark forest with no memory of how you got there, you must find your way home - if it still exists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore haunted villages, forgotten ruins, and cursed temples as you uncover hidden truths about the world and yourself. Along the way, you\u2019ll encounter supernatural forces, solve environmental puzzles, and make difficult choices that shape your path forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world of <i>Kumarn</i> is filled with atmosphere and tension. Shadows move in the corners of your vision. Distant whispers echo through the trees. Every step forward brings you closer to something\u2026 or someone\u2026 watching.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3888420?t=1754548830","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3888420?t=1754548830","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888420/2304972b721d11cceb5c1623edbe7b5510efd395/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754548830","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888420/2304972b721d11cceb5c1623edbe7b5510efd395/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754548830","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>KUMARN</strong></i><br><br>A story-rich horror adventure that follows the journey of a lost spirit child trapped in a mysterious, decaying world. After waking up alone in a dark forest with no memory of how you got there, you must find your way home - if it still exists.</p><p class=